                <span style="margin-left:5px">Renbran Madelo</span>
        </div><div style="margin-bottom:5px">
            <img style="border:0; width:15px; height:15px; vertical-align:text-bottom" src="http://odoo.scholarixglobal.com/calendar/static/src/img/state_needsAction.png">
                <span style="margin-left:5px">You</span>
        </div><div style="margin-bottom:5px">
            <img style="border:0; width:15px; height:15px; vertical-align:text-bottom" src="http://odoo.scholarixglobal.com/calendar/static/src/img/state_needsAction.png">
                <span style="margin-left:5px">Saifulla</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin:32px 0 0">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:12px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#875A7B">Description of the event</h2>
        <div><strong>Organized by</strong><br>MIchael Guido<br><a href="mailto:m.guido@scholarixglobal.com">m.guido@scholarixglobal.com</a><br><br><strong>Contact Details</strong><br>Administrator<br><a href="mailto:info@sgctech.ai">info@sgctech.ai</a><br><a href="tel:+971%2056%20390%205772">+971 56 390 5772</a></div>
